        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c4f04f87-c87f-42d0-b762-ddfc1ad69242\",\"review_text\":\"Love the content\"},{\"review_id\":\"4c3175b5-2499-42b8-964d-34267995b30d\",\"review_text\":\"I like Spotify but not their recommendations. I can't delete them. I don't like that even if we pay premium when I'm listening to podcast you have some announcements.\"},{\"review_id\":\"bf794196-2126-4d00-8dbe-37df2f26143e\",\"review_text\":\"I am disappointed with this app because the last update change the whole spotify its littrally forcing to get premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"310c9889-b37a-403b-80f3-cf47160d4b2e\",\"review_text\":\"தேவையில்லாத விளம்பரங்கள்\"},{\"review_id\":\"79f5daa8-af9e-40e8-8517-5423a4d51155\",\"review_text\":\"I hate 😒 this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"417aa723-cba1-4e9b-8db2-c58a1de96be7\",\"review_text\":\"Always listen to great music because of my taste and the supply. Not so keen on the price increase and I did waiver a bit over this but I play so often and there's more content every time I look so in general I'm happy.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f3ce02f5-229a-4658-9be9-6c292408993a\",\"review_text\":\"Very nice.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4db4666e-a16f-4a17-9b6c-dc6acea84f82\",\"review_text\":\"It's a really good app. Ads are annoying but it's fine and understandable. But why many songs are being deleted or either removed?? I can list many songs which were there on Spotify earlier but now they aren't available. This irritates me a lot. For a music app it's songs are the most important. Due to this, nowadays many people are preferring other platforms for listening music and even I am thinking too. It's a humble request please bring all those songs back which you have removed!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"2988b46a-42ad-4646-8cd3-a0cb75d17469\",\"review_text\":\"App is not good.but stop\"},{\"review_id\":\"a66cc931-d7eb-4cad-9c34-c60cd16e0684\",\"review_text\":\"The update honestly sucks, I don't know why but it just doesn't let me play the music i wanted! Like i would just press the song and it will be a completely different song 😤 it's so frustrating especially when I'm in a bad mood, and one more thing is that when i press a song it will just play for seconds, Fix the update and i will maybe give it a higher rate. For now I'm uninstalling it\"}]}"
      }
